{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "取消全部通告  (Blacklisting the Staged Feud)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in his office, Chun Yuqiao reveals to Xingzi that he knew all along she and Bu Xiaogu snatched the guest booking from ME to protect him, right as Xingzi uncovers the truth behind the red-carpet brawl. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你就让她这么胡闹啊？那个嘉宾是从对手手上抢过来的吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大就是老大，还是瞒不过你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经沦落到了被你们保护的地步了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是有人拼命地想保护你，那感觉是不是也挺好的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "其实这次我挺纠结的，咱们这么做是不是得罪孙总太深了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我只是客观地评断，布小谷的方案没有问题，是合格的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对对对，我不应该这么想问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边有结果了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们是和路条网的边边串通好了，两个人假装打架，实际上就是负面新闻炒作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "取消他们的通告，从现在开始，星天娱乐所有的节目他们不准露面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你要封杀他们？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "能得罪的人，一次都得罪光吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你就让她这么胡闹啊？那个嘉宾是从对手手上抢过来的吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You just let her carry on like that? Those guests were snatched from our rival's hands, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大就是老大，还是瞒不过你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really are the boss; nothing gets past you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经沦落到了被你们保护的地步了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have I fallen to the point of needing all of you to protect me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是有人拼命地想保护你，那感觉是不是也挺好的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet when someone tries with all her might to protect you, does that not feel pretty nice too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "其实这次我挺纠结的，咱们这么做是不是得罪孙总太深了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly I felt torn this time; did doing this offend Mr Sun too deeply?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我只是客观地评断，布小谷的方案没有问题，是合格的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I simply judged objectively: Bu Xiaogu's proposal has no flaws and meets the mark.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对对对，我不应该这么想问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, right, I should not have looked at it that way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边有结果了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is there an update on Xiao Yao and Lv Yi?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们是和路条网的边边串通好了，两个人假装打架，实际上就是负面新闻炒作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They colluded with Bianbian at Lutiao News, pretending to fight as a negative publicity stunt.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "取消他们的通告，从现在开始，星天娱乐所有的节目他们不准露面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cancel their bookings; from now on, they may not appear on any Xingtian Entertainment show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你要封杀他们？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are blacklisting them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "能得罪的人，一次都得罪光吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whoever we might offend, let us offend them all at once.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你就让她这么胡闹啊？那个嘉宾是从对手手上抢过来的吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大就是老大，还是瞒不过你。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经沦落到了被你们保护的地步了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是有人拼命地想保护你，那感觉是不是也挺好的？",
      "gap": 0.5
